WEBVTT

00:00:00.257 --> 00:00:04.670
All communication is about getting someone to care about what you have to say.

00:00:05.122 --> 00:00:08.071
My name's Alex Morgan, and I teach presentation skills at

00:00:08.071 --> 00:00:09.747
a business school you have probably heard of.

00:00:09.971 --> 00:00:15.540
Welcome to Demo Talk. Today, a quick think about saying less.

00:00:18.286 --> 00:00:24.714
Most of us, when we are nervous, do the exact opposite of what works. We keep talking.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.664
We pile on one more example, one more caveat, one more "and another thing," and the point gets buried.

00:00:32.062 --> 00:00:38.836
So here is the technique. Before you speak, finish this sentence in your head: if they remember one thing, it should be...

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:45.900
Then say that thing first. Say it plainly. And then, this is the hard part, stop.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:52.400
Let the silence do some of the work for you. Silence reads as confidence far more often than it reads as confusion.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:58.800
That's it for this quick think. Thanks for joining me, and I'll see you next time on Demo Talk.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:04.900
